{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/mac' data-target='computer\/os\/mac' data-title='Mac'>\r\n\t\t\tMac\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Recreate id_rsa.pub from id_rsa, add a key with ssh-add -K, and enable debug with -vvv.","label":"SSH","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/mac\/setup_usb_installation_media","label":"USB installer","url":"\/computer\/os\/mac\/setup_usb_installation_media"},"nextArticle":null,"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<h2>Generate<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFrom <code class='inline'>~\/.ssh<\/code>, write the public key from the private key:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>cd ~\/.ssh\nssh-keygen -y -f id_rsa &gt; id_rsa.pub<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-y<\/code> reads the private key and prints the public key. <code class='inline'>-f id_rsa<\/code> is the private key file. It will prompt for the passphrase.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPermission: <code class='inline'>0644<\/code> for both <code class='inline'>id_rsa<\/code> and <code class='inline'>id_rsa.pub<\/code>.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Add<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ssh-add -K &lt;path&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-K<\/code> adds the key at <code class='inline'>&lt;path&gt;<\/code>. Permission: <code class='inline'>400<\/code> for only self access.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Debug<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<code class='inline'>-vvv<\/code> is debug:\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>ssh -vvv<\/code><\/pre>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/mac\/ssh\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/os\/mac\/ssh\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/os\/mac\/setup_usb_installation_media' data-target='computer\/os\/mac\/setup_usb_installation_media' data-title='USB installer' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>USB installer<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='item_block-disabled sidebar-nav-norm sidebar-nav-l-1' >\r\n\t\t&nbsp;\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/os\/mac' data-target='computer\/os\/mac' data-title='Mac'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/os\/mac.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Mac<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}